```

## DS Route Authorization — Required for All DS-Facing Routes

Any API route accessed by a Directing Staff (DS) player must call `authorizeDsRoute()` before
processing the request:

```ts
import { authorizeDsRoute } from '@/lib/moat/ds-route-auth'

export async function GET(req: Request, { params }: { params: { id: string } }) {
  const supabase = await createClient()
  const { data: { user } } = await supabase.auth.getUser()
  if (!user) return NextResponse.json({ error: 'Unauthorised' }, { status: 401 })

  // DS routes must also check scope — not just auth
  const authError = await authorizeDsRoute(supabase, user.id, params.dsPlayerId, params.targetPlayerId)
  if (authError) return authError  // returns 403 if scope fails
  // ... route logic
}
```

Affected routes (must have authorizeDsRoute wired):
- `/api/spectral/players/[id]/competency`
- `/api/spectral/players/[id]/training-plan`
- `/api/spectral/exercises/[id]/debrief`
- `/api/spectral/aar`
- `/api/spectral/currency`

## Classification Banner (Legal Requirement)

The banner `UNCLASSIFIED // FOR OFFICIAL TRAINING USE ONLY` must appear on every page.
This is a legal / contractual requirement for operating in defence-adjacent markets.
Do not remove it, hide it, or make it toggleable.

## Data Entry Validation
When users add platforms or scenarios:
- All text fields should be sanitised (no HTML injection)
- Frequency values must be validated as positive numbers within 1 MHz – 100 GHz
- Range values must be validated as positive integers (0 – 20,000 km)
- No file uploads from users (this could be a vector for malicious payloads)

## Audit Logging
Any write operation (scenario creation, platform edit) should log:
- User ID (from Supabase auth)
- Timestamp
- Action type
- Resource ID
This can be a simple Supabase table `audit_log` — don't over-engineer.

## No Publicly Accessible Write Endpoints
All mutation routes must check authentication before processing. The middleware handles page routes, but API routes at `app/api/**/route.ts` must also validate the session:
```ts
const supabase = await createClient()
const { data: { user } } = await supabase.auth.getUser()
if (!user) return NextResponse.json({ error: 'Unauthorised' }, { status: 401 })
```

## Sensitive Data — Never Store
- Real names of personnel associated with platforms
- Coordinates of actual military installations
- Financial or procurement details beyond general cost estimates
- Personal information of course participants
